antag-category-EPC-name = Environmental Preservation Coalition
antag-category-EPC-desc = The EPC is an activist alliance of environmentalists, indigenous-rights groups, and anti-corporate cells who claim Aetheris is strip-mining the sector’s ecosystems and violating the rights of any pre-existing life (or potential life). In reality, many of their cells are funded or directly run by larger interests that simply don’t want a mid-tier corporation like Aetheris consolidating another profitable sector.

antag-category-anomalous-name = Anomalous Threats
antag-category-anomalous-desc = Entities, infections, and phenomena that operate outside conventional corporate or political structures. Often poorly understood and/or extremely dangerous.
